{"title":"Ook Lake","slug":"Ook_Lake","hero":{"file":"Ooklake.webp","width":400,"height":171},"pageid":1374,"revid":17861,"timestamp":"2025-04-20T16:01:13Z","lastEditor":"Nekit20112023","categories":["Locations"],"infobox":{"type":"Buildings","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Purpose","value":"Home to Bamboo"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.0.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"14/01/2023"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n\n<p><br>\nOok lake is a lake that was located on near the end of Finlay Island. Surrounding the lake is a cliff and a beach containing <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Bamboo/\">Bamboo</a>. It has since been moved to the jungle area on Ferwater Island as of the 2024 Spring Update. \n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Image teasing its return.\">Image teasing its return.</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Ooksign.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Image teasing its return.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Ook Lake's new location. Two plants grow in the lake: water lily and lotus.\">Ook Lake's new location. Two plants grow in the lake: water lily and lotus.</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Ooklakenew.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Ook Lake's new location. Two plants grow in the lake: water lily and lotus.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>"}
